Mavind is an OS *distribution*. When built, the resulting ISO image includes
third-party software under its own license terms, including but not limited to:

  - The Linux kernel                     GPL-2.0
  - Debian base packages                 various (see each package's copyright)
  - Wine                                  LGPL-2.1-or-later
  - Mesa                                  MIT / various
  - labwc, wlroots                        MIT
  - GTK                                   LGPL-2.1-or-later
  - systemd                              LGPL-2.1-or-later
  - DXVK, VKD3D-Proton (optional)         zlib / Apache-2.0

The MIT license above applies to the Mavind-authored code in this repository
(build scripts, mavind-shell, minder, mavind-settings, mavind-system-monitor,
mavind-windows-apps, mpk, installer, docs).
